            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, I was able to reproduce. It appeared as a 'mini.misc' issue: `zoom()` window was opened with very big dimensions to not have to compute them. Big height in particular lead to this issue of redrawing command line, presumably because window was drawn beneath it. Properly computing and updating dimensions seems to fix this on latest `main`.\r\n\r\nThanks again for finding this!",
