            "body": "> Yes, I was able to reproduce. It appeared as a 'mini.misc' issue: `zoom()` window was opened with very big dimensions to not have to compute them. Big height in particular lead to this issue of redrawing command line, presumably because window was drawn beneath it. Properly computing and updating dimensions seems to fix this on latest `main`.\r\n> \r\n> Thanks again for finding this!\r\n\r\nAs always, awesome work and fastest fixes. You are a beast @echasnovski! Hope I become a software engineer like you one day!!",
